                    {
                        "form_id": "86346a28-f4b8-434a-80c3-9b93bcae06f4",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "zombi"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d5cb10eb-baec-490f-94c7-d08eb94aa132",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "Selon les croyances, les vaudous utilisaient les zombis comme de véritables marionnettes."
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f103e480-0fe7-3328-8fc6-8dc12e380adf",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Revenant, mort qui marche ; cadavre victime d’un sortilège vaudou aux Antilles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fantastique",
                            "Vaudou"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f5b1619-ae27-3df4-9bf7-8bff10316723",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dans les fictions populaires à partir du XXᵉ siècle, mort-vivant dont le corps est en état de décomposition, se déplaçant généralement de façon lente et maladroite, et ayant pour principal but de faire des victimes humaines en les transformant à leur tour en zombies par une morsure."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e5c17d6-3d9b-4959-9081-1940f3feaa28",
                                "sense_id": "8f5b1619-ae27-3df4-9bf7-8bff10316723",
                                "text": "Pendant les semaines qui viennent, nous allons donc marcher très lentement (les zombies ne courent pas !) en attendant de retrouver ces cerveaux qui nous manquent (« Braiiins »)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9b62c9a-8c75-42e7-9bfb-2fb0bc66df6f",
                                "sense_id": "8f5b1619-ae27-3df4-9bf7-8bff10316723",
                                "text": "Contrairement aux humains dont il faut éduquer et redresser les penchants barbares, les zombies réintroduisent une barbarie pure et totale que les épisodes les plus sombres de l’humanité ne parviennent même pas à égaler. Le zombie est une forme humaine qu’on ne peut traiter humainement. Face aux zombies, la défense de la civilisation devient une guerre totale : c’est une guerre pour la survie de l’humanité […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5889240-9865-41a1-b17f-86de1a4e78fc",
                                "sense_id": "8f5b1619-ae27-3df4-9bf7-8bff10316723",
                                "text": "Bizarrement, son cadavre sanglant ne la dérangeait pas : il lui faisait à peu près le même effet qu’un zombie de pacotille dans une maison hantée de fête foraine."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "38b50b5d-462e-3a31-a1d2-3fd445482618",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne à l’allure cadavérique ou vide et sans volonté propre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "281fce38-9594-4fd0-81fc-e2b0911b4c7b",
                                "sense_id": "38b50b5d-462e-3a31-a1d2-3fd445482618",
                                "text": "Sans la chrétienté, les nations européennes n’étaient plus que des corps sans âme — des zombies. Seulement, voilà : la chrétienté pourrait-elle revivre ? Je l'ai cru, je l'ai cru quelques années — avec des doutes croissants, j’étais de plus en plus marqué par la pensée de Toynbee, par son idée que les civilisations ne meurent pas assassinées, mais qu’elles se suicident […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f365454b-58a3-4e21-8def-1d330f2ce4d8",
                                "sense_id": "38b50b5d-462e-3a31-a1d2-3fd445482618",
                                "text": "Entre les réveils en pleine nuit, les pleurs, les changements de couches, les biberons, je ressemblais à un zombie. […]. J'étais au radar pendant un mois tant que le p’tit ne faisait pas ses nuits […]."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd039dff-c1c5-3d0c-b242-0f1f140a07aa",
                        "entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ordinateur contrôlé à l’insu de son propriétaire par un tiers distant, généralement à la suite d’une compromission de sécurité par un cheval de Troie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Sécurité informatique"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96c1b9d0-85c2-460d-b436-6740de8aa4b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zombie",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zombie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "721854bc-8646-321b-8d5d-245c0c1b4d7a",
                                        "entry_id": "fb3eb79c-55b3-35f3-a6bd-7ef125d017ac",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Untoter, wandelnde Leiche"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "fiktives Wesen"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b00015be-89b9-4727-b3d3-ba74aa12334e",
                                                "sense_id": "721854bc-8646-321b-8d5d-245c0c1b4d7a",
                                                "text": "Die Zombies gehen schneller kaputt, wenn man ihnen den Kopf abschießt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5fbcc5c-32d5-4564-985f-8f5b1ba5aad5",
                                                "sense_id": "721854bc-8646-321b-8d5d-245c0c1b4d7a",
                                                "text": "„Zombies muss man in Potsdam auch nicht lange suchen, man fand jede Menge Komparsen für ein Kleingeld.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930bb798-2e74-489c-b22f-c0ffaa5bc9aa",
                                                "sense_id": "721854bc-8646-321b-8d5d-245c0c1b4d7a",
                                                "text": "„Wir stolperten wie Zombies in unsere Zimmer und waren auch bald im Bett, und so konnte Hamid endlich seine Familie besuchen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8eef816-028a-48fc-b4aa-9a2d8222a9eb",
                        "source_entry_id": "95f8bae6-c0c8-3c5f-a509-1cf87ac9d659",
                        "target_lang_word": "zombie",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zombie",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b2b868d-7876-31ab-b0e8-af2e4da5e178",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person, usually undead, animated by unnatural forces (such as magic), with no soul or will of his or her own."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3592dd0f-3266-4efc-8f23-fc2f7712078c",
                                                "sense_id": "4b2b868d-7876-31ab-b0e8-af2e4da5e178",
                                                "text": "Betsy Connell: I don't know about zombies, doctor. Just what is a zombie? / Dr. Maxwell: A ghost. A living dead. It's also a drink."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c794445-2890-4ce5-891a-0d15c09ab3f3",
                                                "sense_id": "4b2b868d-7876-31ab-b0e8-af2e4da5e178",
                                                "text": "The zombies were having fun\nThe party had just begun\nThe guests included Wolf-Man, Dracula, and his son."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd57dd96-a133-4c3a-b9e9-6b6544dcbc9e",
                                                "sense_id": "4b2b868d-7876-31ab-b0e8-af2e4da5e178",
                                                "text": "Ashley: Dad passed on a few years back. He's probably still watching, though.\nShepard: He's not a zombie, is he?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3562bef7-f4d8-42dc-9fe6-3873949ad19d",
                                                "sense_id": "4b2b868d-7876-31ab-b0e8-af2e4da5e178",
                                                "text": "The zombies first show up 20 minutes in, after Melanie volunteers herself as the next child to mysteriously disappear in the middle of the night. That’s when we learn that Melanie and her classmates are all “hungries,” or people infected with a toxic fungus that turns them into mindless flesh-eating animals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e31225d-7bb5-33a8-bb04-8b356b9ea4c6",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An apathetic or slow-witted person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7944533-21e5-33ed-9d7f-4bef9172e225",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A human being in a state of extreme mental exhaustion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "720703b2-a830-418e-aca2-49079666102d",
                                                "sense_id": "b7944533-21e5-33ed-9d7f-4bef9172e225",
                                                "text": "After working for 18 hours on the computer, I was a zombie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b4dfd6f3-7446-30d5-83f0-517c2e80772d",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that should be dead but is not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "add11cea-6233-4a94-85c5-cb06411445a5",
                                                "sense_id": "b4dfd6f3-7446-30d5-83f0-517c2e80772d",
                                                "text": "I would advise anyone who does not share its politics — surely the great majority of gay men and lesbians — to shun NOLAG for the anachronistic zombie it is."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "961d7e35-bb41-3785-8798-69798ffe366c",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An information worker who has signed a nondisclosure agreement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea55a397-8686-3ac8-a9a7-8d987a6a91e0",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process or task which has terminated but has not been removed from the list of processes, typically because it has an unresponsive parent process."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a8c3355-a23d-46b1-8b61-385b52dfec65",
                                                "sense_id": "ea55a397-8686-3ac8-a9a7-8d987a6a91e0",
                                                "text": "1986, Maurice J. Bach, The Design of the Unix Operating System, Prentice-Hall, Englewood Cliffs, New Jersey, USA, See \"Process States and Transitions,\" p. 147.\n9. The process executed the exit system call and is in the zombie state. The process no longer exists, but it leaves a record containing an exit code and some timing statistics for its parent process to collect. The zombie state is the final state of a process."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d169c7a7-bf05-3142-8c76-bc9d96bebc87",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A computer affected by malware which causes it to do whatever the attacker wants it to do without the user's knowledge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8a9973d-d585-37d1-84f2-e31e6e3cf2c4",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cocktail of rum and fruit juices."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6a7c993-38ca-42f7-885c-eb116f225d83",
                                                "sense_id": "b8a9973d-d585-37d1-84f2-e31e6e3cf2c4",
                                                "text": "She takes the taxi to the good hotel / Bon marché as far as she can tell / She drinks the zombie from the cocoa shell"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1568690-869a-458e-b68b-37d8cd1cd4f3",
                                                "sense_id": "b8a9973d-d585-37d1-84f2-e31e6e3cf2c4",
                                                "text": "The maitre d’ introduced us and I had a zombie with him. Those zombies are wicked.\n[…]\nI watched Mario and drank zombies out of a thermos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3d136f4-055b-3e81-8133-cf4a823226f4",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A conscripted member of the Canadian military during World War II who was assigned to home defence rather than to combat in Europe."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81aa5f32-cedf-49dc-abf7-fd6e7b67eaba",
                                                "sense_id": "e3d136f4-055b-3e81-8133-cf4a823226f4",
                                                "text": "1944, \"Time for Decision,\" Time (US edition), 6 Nov.,\nHad the time come to order Canada's home defense draftees—some 70,000 zombies idling at home—to battle overseas?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc8cc1a8-5bc1-31b9-94de-5eb0ea2220b3",
                                        "entry_id": "3a1047e7-a8d2-3811-9474-52573786da56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marijuana, or similar drugs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89fd1e6b-964b-44ae-9e91-5bda7983210b",
                                                "sense_id": "dc8cc1a8-5bc1-31b9-94de-5eb0ea2220b3",
                                                "text": "Traveling in a fried-out Kombi / On a hippie trail, head full of zombie"
